- [MCP Security Best Practices（2026-07-28）](https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/2026-07-28/tutorials/security/security_best_practices)', 'JavaGuide, 后端知识体系, 高可用与系统架构设计', '高可用与系统架构设计', 1, 0, 'jg-3314', NOW(), NOW()),
(3315, 'LLM/Agent 安全实战：从 Prompt Injection、工具越权到沙箱隔离：官方工程资料核心原理与实践', '- [OpenAI：Understanding Prompt Injections](https://openai.com/safety/prompt-injections/)
- [OpenAI Agents SDK：Human-in-the-loop](https://openai.github.io/openai-agents-python/human_in_the_loop/)
