- [JEP 486: Permanently Disable the Security Manager](https://openjdk.org/jeps/486)', 'JavaGuide, 后端知识体系, 高可用与系统架构设计', '高可用与系统架构设计', 1, 0, 'jg-3315', NOW(), NOW()),
(3316, 'LLM/Agent 安全实战：从 Prompt Injection、工具越权到沙箱隔离：JavaGuide 相关阅读核心原理与实践', '- [大模型提示词工程](../agent/prompt-engineering.md)
- [大模型结构化输出与 Function Calling](../llm-basis/structured-output-function-calling.md)
- [MCP 详解](../agent/mcp.md)
