(3943, 'LRU 缓存面试题总结：哈希表、双向链表与 LinkedHashMap：参考资料核心原理与实践', '- [Java SE 17 API：LinkedHashMap](https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/LinkedHashMap.html)
