**思路：**这题和上一题都是一样的数据，只是查询条件改变了而已，上一题理解了，这题分分钟做出来。

**答案**：

```sql
SELECT u_info.LEVEL AS LEVEL,
       count(u_info.uid) AS level_cnt
FROM examination_info e_info
INNER JOIN exam_record record
INNER JOIN user_info u_info
