试卷作答记录表 `exam_record`（`uid` 用户 ID, `exam_id` 试卷 ID, `start_time` 开始作答时间, `submit_time` 交卷时间, `score` 得分）：

| id  | uid  | exam_id | start_time          | submit_time         | score  |
| --- | ---- | ------- | ------------------- | ------------------- | ------ |
