- [测试开发学习路线（2026 最新版）](../../roadmap/test-development-roadmap.md)', 'JavaGuide, 后端知识体系, Java核心与并发', 'Java核心与并发', 1, 0, 'jg-6093', NOW(), NOW()),
(6094, '程序员职业方向怎么选？：参考资料核心原理与实践', '- [CMU Database Group：Courses](https://db.cs.cmu.edu/courses)
- [CMU 15-445/645: Intro to Database Systems](https://15445.courses.cs.cmu.edu)
- [Google Cloud：What is MLOps?](https://cloud.google.com/discover/what-is-mlops)
